    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51ba79299afc079f0d6ff45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "俱乐部历史悠久，累积的资料量也十分庞大。\n我慎重地翻开第一页……",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a3c77a2b93d85156e3d019a7492f19b0214ffad0fdf36ca5028eb91204a907",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
