      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7402ab171b1d864dfad75512",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅因为一次疏忽造成的\n不成比例的惨痛代价及伤痛。\n曾含泪离开舞台的选手们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72716631a720aa4b1a1bc64be77c8b606b121fef907362d1a6194ab9b5ab9b7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c456e3ba5794d8175f374b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……资料中深刻地记载着\n至今历代竞赛选手们肩负的沉痛风险。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245b1e0bb28dcebefb72e007bd988a4df1416be8e3fc7e84ba229d2a5b379471",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
