    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830dda674c2694a36aaa1a0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天樱花桂冠获得了支持度第一名。\n当地的播报员也不断喊着她的名字。\n她的表现备受瞩目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e2e695ee18d8d42b97256a03bc146e723c7fe38498495bf3272e3658f385bbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022ca6a21dab22c65c2506bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "照这步调继续下去，她无疑能够拿下第一名。\n樱花桂冠冲过赛道，破风前行──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25a738cd4c3d1c86351e997be222937ea6dd4c757f42dbd8d05d41e58277ef5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
